<Layout title="Neon City | Your Las Vegas Smoke Shop!" description="Visit Neon City Smoke Shop in Las Vegas for adult smoking essentials and accessories, or find the shop's location, hours, articles, and contact information.">
  <VideoHero />
  <section id="about" class="about-section"><div class="shell about-grid"><div class="brand-panel source-photo"><picture><source srcset="/images/neon-city-about.avif" type="image/avif" /><img src="/images/neon-city-about.webp" width="800" height="1067" alt="Portrait in drifting smoke" loading="lazy" /></picture></div><div><p class="eyebrow">About us</p><h2>Who we are</h2><p>Neon City Smoke Shop, we take immense pride in our role as a premier destination for discerning smoking product enthusiasts. Nestled within the lively heart of Las Vegas, our establishment embodies a commitment to excellence and innovation in every aspect of the smoking experience.</p><p>Our story begins with a passion for curating the finest selection of smoking accessories available. We believe that every customer deserves access to high-quality products that enhance their smoking journey. With this vision in mind, we’ve meticulously curated our inventory to showcase an unparalleled variety of smoking essentials.</p><a class="button" href="/about/">More about us <span aria-hidden="true">›</span></a></div></div></section>
  <SupportSections />
  <ContactForm heading="How can we help?" />
</Layout>
